ng emerged. [...] The other cities had their financial institutions, though not as extensive as Amsterdam. Most had their own Bank van Leening, their own bankers, and of course the receiver of taxes who functioned at times as a banker." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 865, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 783})
